              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "AYA"
            },
            "reviewBody": "so good I used it as a snack.---and I didn't share last time. I prefer to bake beets wrapped in aluminum foil---350 for 1 hour. Used regular mustard and skipped the horseradish.",
