              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Julie Taylor"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I have never considered myself to be a beet eater, but this was the house specialty at a supper club we visited, and I just had to find the recipe. I'm actually finding myself reaching for this rather than any of my usual snack options. (Believe me, I NEVER expected that!) I will be making this very often!",
